        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 142,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_05",
      "hash64": "7FE2FF73EF519F8B",
      "text": "¡Enseguida![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 11,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "common_0230_head_teacher_05",
      "hash64": "C0DB5422B31FACE8",
      "text": "Vaya, mirad qué tarde es. Dirigíos a vuestra aula,\\nchic[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oas. Las clases están a punto de comenzar.[VAR 0x0114(000A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 102,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "000A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "common_0230_rival_06",
      "hash64": "7FE30073EF51A13E",
      "text": "¿Sabes dónde está 1.º A, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\nNo te preocupes, que yo te acompaño. ¡Vamos![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
